+
+commit b3f33cbf7ace8fc149993ee35e0d0fd57f41d6d8 upstream.
+
+SandyBridge should be using the same register addresses as IvyBridge.
+
+Signed-off-by: Wu Fengguang <fengguang.wu@intel.com>
